#### 43. **CertGenUtils.java:223-229** — Overload with `signatureAlgorithm` but no `keyUsage`:
```java
public static X509Certificate generateSignedCertificate(
    ...
    String signatureAlgorithm,
    Set<ExtendedKeyUsage> extendedKeyUsages
) {
    return generateSignedCertificate(
        ...
        signatureAlgorithm,
        null,  // keyUsage = null
        Set.of()
    );
}
```
This overload **drops** the `keyUsage` parameter (sets to null). Callers using this overload cannot specify keyUsage. **API gap.**

